[37.553209, "o", "7:This index orients readers only. Reconciliation rules appear inside Investigation Briefs 01–08 and the Mid-Year Amendment in Brief 09. Draft narrative, decoy sections, and archived threads are not authoritative. Structured source data appears near the file end under Email Excerpts, Policy Exceptions, Correction Notices, and the canonical Transaction Ledger heading.\r\n11:## Investigation Brief 01 — Ledger Sourcing\r\n26:## Investigation Brief 01 — Ledger Sourcing — supporting chronology\r\n214:## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence\r\n222:## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence — supporting chronology\r\n384:## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing\r\n393:## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing — supporting chronology\r\n555:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence\r\n564:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence — supporting chronology\r\n672:## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners\r\n"]
[37.553535, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[37.553617, "o", "root@8eb6883b8e1c:/app# "]
[38.266222, "i", "python3 - <<'PY'\nimport re\npath='/app/data/audit_archive.md'\ntext=open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8').read().splitlines()\nidx=[(i+1,l) for i,l in enumerate(text) if re.search(r'Investigation Brief\\s+0?[1-9]\\b',l)]\nprint('brief headers:',len(idx))\nfor i,(ln,l) in enumerate(idx[:30]):\n    print(ln,l[:120])\nPY\n"]
[38.268196, "o", "python3 - <<'PY'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> import re\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> path='/app/data/audit_archive.md'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> text=open(path,'r',encoding='utf-8').read().splitlines()\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> idx=[(i+1,l) for i,l in enumerate(text) if re.search(r'Investigation Brief\\s+0?[1-9]\\b',l)]\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> print('brief headers:',len(idx))\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> for i,(ln,l) in enumerate(idx[:30]):\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h>     print(ln,l[:120])\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> PY\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
